## Test

```text
codegen::bindings::primitive::tests::casts_f64_to_f32
```

## Source

```rs
let from = SourceType {
    value: Type::Primitive(Primitive::f64),
    mode: PassMode::Owned,
};
let to = SourceType {
    value: Type::Primitive(Primitive::f32),
    mode: PassMode::Owned,
};
snapshot_for_apis(|db| {
    DirectCastRule::compile(CastF64ToF32Rule, db, from, to, "input").print()
})
```

## Output

```rs
// Node
{
	input as f32
}

// Wasm
{
	input as f32
}
```
